  4.0008291318473263`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"64368697-9dcc-480d-83ea-\
e952cba582d2"],

Cell["\<\
It is free to you, but affords the developers of open-source packages very \
little\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0008291207189703`*^9, 4.000829177128627*^9}, {
  4.0008292272463512`*^9, 
  4.000829232747286*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eb3289e3-fd50-4738-9dec-\
a4e7d34af816"],

Cell["\<\
Corporations and companies make billions of dollars from software written by \
open-source languages and the developers of packages for those languages get \
very little in return\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0008291207189703`*^9, 4.000829177128627*^9}, {
  4.0008292272463512`*^9, 
  4.000829284854656*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6e26767a-3ba4-4e37-b6a6-\
7196b17e7600"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
It is absolutely necessary to advocate that developers of open-source \
packages be compensated for their efforts\
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0008291207189703`*^9, 4.000829177128627*^9}, {
  4.000829228727131*^9, 4.000829229642384*^9}, {4.0008292893955812`*^9, 
